Gad Saad Makes Joe Rogan Go Silent with how Suicidal Empathy really works in Humans and the Animal Kingdom.

@RubinReport: "@GadSaad is an unbelievable communicator... his idea of the "wood cricket" is exactly what's happening in LA. He talks about hijacking your cognitive and emotional system... so If your cognitive system is hijacked, homelessness feels normal; if your emotional system is hijacked, you stop wanting to actually help, so you instead let them be..."

